00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:18,960
I mean, like, I hear, you know, even very smart,

289
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,680
I want to say even very smart teenagers,

290
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:23,320
I almost want to say especially very smart teenagers,

291
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,280
like, read one science fiction book,

