00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:49,760
It's possible, but seems suspicious.

305
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:52,120
All right, so what I'm saying, in the real world,

306
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:54,880
it's always easy to say, oh, none of the examples

307
00:11:54,880 --> 00:11:55,840
are really any good.

308
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:57,680
The endowment effect, status quo bias,

309
00:11:57,680 --> 00:12:00,640
say it's transactions cost, you can say it's information cost.

310
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:02,720
And again, if you start thinking about

311
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:05,280
why is something your endowment,

