00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:01,800
What are the standardized features of a Big Mac?

343
00:13:01,800 --> 00:13:03,840
Two all-beef patties, special sauce,

344
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:05,400
lettuce, cheese, pickles, onions,

345
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:06,800
on a sesame seed bun.

346
00:13:06,800 --> 00:13:07,920
All right, that one.

